    art="J.M.W. Turner (master of light and atmospheric sea storms: The Fighting Temeraire - Turner Prize named in his honor); John Constable (The Hay Wain); William Blake; Pre-Raphaelite Brotherhood (Dante Gabriel Rossetti, John Everett Millais); 20th-century titans: Henry Moore (monumental bronze reclining figures), Francis Bacon, Lucian Freud, David Hockney (A Bigger Splash); contemporary provocateurs: Damien Hirst (Young British Artists / YBA), Banksy (world-famous elusive satirical street artist); Tate Britain, Tate Modern, National Gallery in London.",
