    worldHeritageSites=["Stonehenge, Avebury and Associated Sites (1986)", "Castles and Town Walls of King Edward in Gwynedd (Wales - 1986: Caernarfon, Conwy, Beaumaris)", "Giant's Causeway and Causeway Coast (Northern Ireland - 1986: 40,000 interlocking basalt columns)", "Palace of Westminster and Westminster Abbey including Saint Margaret's Church (1987)", "Tower of London (1988)", "Old and New Towns of Edinburgh (1995)", "Maritime Greenwich (1997)", "Canterbury Cathedral, St Augustine's Abbey, and St Martin's Church (1988)", "Heart of Neolithic Orkney (1999)", "City of Bath (1987)", "Blenheim Palace (1987 - birthplace of Winston Churchill)", "Dorset and East Devon Coast / Jurassic Coast (2001 - 185 million years of geological history)", "Royal Botanic Gardens, Kew (2003)", "Pontcysyllte Aqueduct and Canal (Wales - 2009)", "The Forth Bridge (Scotland - 2015)", "The English Lake District (2017)", "Jodrell Bank Observatory (2019)", "The Great Spa Towns of Europe (City of Bath - 2021)", "Slate Landscape of Northwest Wales (2021)", "Hopewell Ceremonial Earthworks"],
